<body>
    <h1>Identity Model</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p><u>Product Requirement Document</u>:&nbsp;<a href=3D"/spaces/COM=
PASS/pages/2621821875/PRD+Unified+Multi-Firm+Access">PRD Unified Multi-Firm=
 Access</a></p>
<h1 id=3D"IdentityModel-FUM1.x">FUM 1.x</h1>
<p><u>Database Schema</u>: <a href=3D"/spaces/NA/pages/1097763182/Firm+and+=
User+Management+FUM#FirmandUserManagement(FUM)-Model">Firm and User Managem=
ent (FUM)#Model</a></p>
<p><img class=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"468" style=3D"width:1701px;=
max-width: 100%;" src=3D"d19064439d0e930b0b2468567e01ff74f00bce8690c5595eda=
5feef8770c408a" height=3D"344"></p>
<h1 id=3D"IdentityModel-Appendix">Appendix</h1>
<h2 id=3D"IdentityModel-GeneralContext">General Context</h2>
<p><u>Main systems</u><span style=3D"color:#000000;">:</span></p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"08084309-35df-4753-bd07-6495d3b87a68">Firm &amp; User Man=
agement (F&amp;UM)=20
  <ul>
   <li>User identity</li>
   <li><span>Firm entitlement</span></li>
   <li>User entitlement</li>
   <li>Access management</li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"0db6ac7f-3562-413a-95e8-a7cbd0876ac6">Firm 360=20
  <ul>
   <li>Consolidates data from many systems (e.g. Salesforce, OSS)</li>
   <li>Firm management=20
    <ul>
     <li>Firm onboarding</li>
     <li>RR-Code assignment (manually read from OSS)</li>
     <li>Firm relationship (hierarchy)&nbsp;</li>
    </ul></li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"80fca5e0-68f6-48c7-95b2-3fdf8c1156e1">OSS (Kyndryl)=20
  <ul>
   <li>BoR=20
    <ul>
     <li>Accounts, cash, assets, portfolio, financial products, ...</li>
    </ul></li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<p><u>Firm types</u><span style=3D"color:#000000;">:</span></p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"7123fdb1-dc7a-42f1-a1b8-c0db62e8aa87">External=20
  <ul>
   <li>IB (p.s. No branch code)</li>
   <li>PM</li>
   <li>IFM</li>
   <li>Others (not well defined yet)</li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"d16a69e8-8dbd-4c40-acad-e1b96d54737a">Internal=20
  <ul>
   <li>NBIN=20
    <ul>
     <li>Internal operations/management</li>
    </ul></li>
   <li>COR=20
    <ul>
     <li>Testing (w/ mocked rr-codes)</li>
    </ul></li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<p><u>Firm identifiers</u>:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"666bec1e-7798-4c72-b132-2347e98fea6b">Firm ID=20
  <ul>
   <li>Unique across all firms=20
    <ul>
     <li>IB firm's=20
      <ul>
       <li>Broker code</li>
      </ul></li>
     <li>PM firm's=20
      <ul>
       <li>Broker code + "_" + branch code</li>
      </ul></li>
    </ul></li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"e96f6d85-9468-45ff-96ad-0b6b4571ff51">Broker code=20
  <ul>
   <li>Unique per (associated) IB firm</li>
   <li>Shareable by other firm types</li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"410160c7-97f7-4b1e-96d8-3cd475436e35">Branch code=20
  <ul>
   <li>Unique per (associated) firm</li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"2abe077c-763f-45cf-ad49-d91d87d2b576">Rep codes (aka&nbsp=
;<u>R</u>egistered&nbsp;<u>R</u>epresentative Code)=20
  <ul>
   <li>Unique per broker code</li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<p><u>Firm hierarchy and advisory model</u>:</p>
<p><img class=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"400" style=3D"width:400px;m=
ax-width: 100%;" src=3D"ed8e1976707025c123f29bbb40116183ba545ce730dc590f746=
d13f707508f84" height=3D"294"></p>
